diff --git a/docs/api.rst b/docs/api.rst
index b2db5375..000dd6e9 100644
--- a/docs/api.rst
+++ b/docs/api.rst
@@ -442,6 +442,18 @@ own loader, subclass :class:`BaseLoader` and override `get_source`.
 
 Here a list of the builtin loaders Jinja provides:
 
+The builtin loaders accept an optional ``path_transform`` callable.
+It rewrites a requested name before lookup; ``None`` preserves the
+ordinary behavior. Each configured layer transforms once per uncached
+load or source request. Prefix routing happens after transformation.
+The callable must return a string; its exceptions propagate unchanged.
+Missing templates still report the original request name.
+
+Filesystem safety checks apply to the rewritten name. Stored template
+lists are not transformed. Environment caching remains keyed by the
+original public name. Prefix and choice loaders retain child source,
+freshness, globals, and source-less precompiled loading protocols.
+
 .. autoclass:: jinja2.FileSystemLoader
 
 .. autoclass:: jinja2.PackageLoader
